<title>UK: Morgan Stanley set calls on German chemical basket.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley set calls on German chemical basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley Werpapiere GmbH has issued 10 million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on an equally weighted basket of German chemical firms, lead manager Morgan Stanley Bank AG said.</p>
<p>The basket includes Bayer AG, Hoechst AG</p>
<p>and BASF AG.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	27.APR.98		 PAYDATE	25.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRANKFURT		 MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>TEN WARRANTS CONTROL ONE UNDERLYING.  BASKET VALUE 1000 DEM</p>
<p>+ + + + + +</p>
<p>		 STRIKE	ISSUE     PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL	  1000 DEM    10.0 DEM  10.0 PCT     10.00 X</p>
<p> CALL	  1050 DEM    7.60 DEM  12.60 PCT    13.16 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
